---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import alaiLogo from '../assets/images/community/alai-logo.png';
import goodooLogo from '../assets/images/community/goodoo-logo.png';

import rockyRedhat from '../assets/images/community/rocky/rocky-redhat.png';
import rockySmile from '../assets/images/community/rocky/rocky-smile.png';
import rockyDay1 from '../assets/images/community/rocky/rocky-day1.jpg';
import rockyWeek2 from '../assets/images/community/rocky/rocky-week2.jpg';
import rockyCar from '../assets/images/community/rocky/rocky-car.jpg';
import rockyBeach from '../assets/images/community/rocky/rocky-beach.jpg';
import rockyJump from '../assets/images/community/rocky/rocky-jump.jpg';
import rockyBed from '../assets/images/community/rocky/rocky-bed.jpg';

import sukhiResting from '../assets/images/community/sukhi/sukhi-resting.png';
import sukhiPortrait2 from '../assets/images/community/sukhi/sukhi-portrait2.jpg';
import sukhiClose from '../assets/images/community/sukhi/sukhi-close.jpg';
import sukhiHappy2 from '../assets/images/community/sukhi/sukhi-happy2.png';

import feedGroupWaiting from '../assets/images/community/feeding/group-waiting.png';
import feedCuriousLook from '../assets/images/community/feeding/curious-look.png';
import feedPuppyGrown from '../assets/images/community/feeding/puppy-grown.jpg';
import feedPuppiesGrown from '../assets/images/community/feeding/puppies-grown.jpg';
import feedDogStanding from '../assets/images/community/feeding/dog-standing.png';
import feedNightFeed from '../assets/images/community/feeding/night-feed.png';

import miliAlive from '../assets/images/community/mili/mili-alive.jpg';
import anniRescue from '../assets/images/community/anni/anni-rescue.jpg';
import anniInjury from '../assets/images/community/anni/anni-injury.jpg';
import cocoInjury from '../assets/images/community/coco/coco-injury.jpg';
import brunoReunited from '../assets/images/community/bruno/bruno-reunited.jpg';
import departedDogBlurred from '../assets/images/community/departed/departed-dog-blurred.png';
---

<BaseLayout title="Beyond Code — Animal Rescue & Community Care" description="Street rescues, daily community dog care, and giving dignity to every life — the things that matter beyond the keyboard.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/[0.05] via-background to-green/[0.05]"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_50%_30%,rgba(245,158,11,0.07)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div>
    <div class="relative container-main max-w-5xl pt-24 md:pt-28 pb-14">
      <a href="/#beyond-code" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-secondary hover:text-green transition-colors mb-8 font-mono">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" /></svg>
        Back to home
      </a>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-10">
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 rounded">Since 2024</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-foreground mb-8">Beyond Code</h1>
          <div class="text-base md:text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed space-y-5">
            <p>One evening in 2024, I walked past a stray dog on the side of a Bangalore road. Malnourished. Invisible. Hundreds of people had done the same thing that day. Something made me stop, pick him up, and bring him home. I named him Rocky.</p>
            <p>That single decision changed the way I see the world. Since then, I've rescued and rehabilitated street animals, coordinated emergency medical care with shelters across Bangalore, and — every single night since 2025 — fed and cared for around 20 community dogs in my neighborhood in North Bangalore.</p>
            <p class="text-foreground/70 font-medium">Not all of these stories end well. I share them anyway — because the ones that don't matter just as much.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden md:block relative w-[320px] h-[380px] shrink-0">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(245,158,11,0.08)_0%,transparent_70%)]"></div>
          <div class="hero-bubble absolute w-36 h-36 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-amber-500/30 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/10" style="top:10%;left:15%;animation:float-1 6s ease-in-out infinite"><Image src={rockySmile} alt="Rocky" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="hero-bubble absolute w-28 h-28 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-green/30 shadow-lg shadow-green/10" style="top:5%;right:5%;animation:float-2 7s ease-in-out infinite"><Image src={miliAlive} alt="Mili" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="hero-bubble absolute w-32 h-32 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-violet-500/30 shadow-lg shadow-violet-500/10" style="bottom:10%;left:5%;animation:float-3 8s ease-in-out infinite"><Image src={sukhiClose} alt="Sukhi" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="hero-bubble absolute w-24 h-24 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-rose-500/30 shadow-lg shadow-rose-500/10" style="top:45%;right:0%;animation:float-4 5s ease-in-out infinite"><Image src={brunoReunited} alt="Bruno" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="hero-bubble absolute w-20 h-20 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-cyan-500/20 shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/10" style="bottom:5%;right:20%;animation:float-5 6.5s ease-in-out infinite"><Image src={feedDogStanding} alt="Community dog" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="hero-bubble absolute w-16 h-16 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-amber-500/20 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/10" style="top:55%;left:0%;animation:float-6 7.5s ease-in-out infinite"><Image src={feedNightFeed} alt="Community dog" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stories -->
  <section class="container-main max-w-5xl py-16 md:py-20 space-y-20 md:space-y-28">

    <!-- ══ 01 · ROCKY · 2024 — FEATURED ══ -->
    <article class="relative">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400">01</span>
        <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-amber-500/30"></div>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono">2024</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide">Featured Story</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">Rocky — Where It All Began</h2>
      <div class="text-sm md:text-base text-secondary leading-relaxed space-y-5 max-w-3xl">
        <p>Malnourished. Terrified. Lying on the side of a road in Bangalore while hundreds of people walked past him like he wasn't there. I almost did the same.</p>
        <p>There was no plan. No experience. I just picked him up, drove to the nearest vet, got him treated, and brought him home. I named him Rocky — because he'd survived long enough to earn it.</p>
        <p>What I didn't realize at the time was that Rocky would change everything. He didn't just get rescued that day — he rewired the way I see the world. Once you carry one dog off the street, every limping stray, every puppy shivering in the rain, every dog flinching from a passing bike — it all becomes impossible to ignore. Rocky is the reason every story on this page exists. He's family now.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border bg-black media-player" data-player="rocky">
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/9] md:aspect-[21/9]">
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Day 1 — the day I found him"><img src={rockyDay1.src} alt="Rocky day 1" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="eager" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Week 2 — starting to trust"><img src={rockyWeek2.src} alt="Rocky week 2" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="The smile that changed everything"><img src={rockySmile.src} alt="Rocky smiling" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="King of the bed"><img src={rockyBed.src} alt="Rocky in bed" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Road trips with Rocky"><img src={rockyCar.src} alt="Rocky car ride" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Rocky rocking Red Hat"><img src={rockyRedhat.src} alt="Rocky in Red Hat" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Beach day in Goa — family trip"><img src={rockyBeach.src} alt="Rocky at beach" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Mid-air acrobatics"><img src={rockyJump.src} alt="Rocky jumping" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="video" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Rocky having fun">
            <video class="w-full h-full object-contain" playsinline preload="none" muted loop><source src="/rocky-today.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-black/20 pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-5 z-10"><span class="player-label text-sm text-white/90 font-medium">Day 1 — the day I found him</span></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-5 flex gap-1.5 z-10 player-dots"></div>
          <button class="nav-prev absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 hover:bg-black/60 transition-all z-10"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg></button>
          <button class="nav-next absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 hover:bg-black/60 transition-all z-10"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-5 py-2 flex items-center justify-end">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-white/30 font-mono">8 photos · 1 video</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ══ 02 · MILI · 2024 ══ -->
    <article>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400">02</span>
        <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-border"></div>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono">2024</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-foreground/10 text-foreground/60 text-xs">In Memory 🕊️</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">Mili</h2>
      <div class="text-sm md:text-base text-secondary leading-relaxed space-y-5 max-w-3xl">
        <p>Mili was the kind of dog who made the street feel less like a street. Full of energy, always the first to come running when she heard footsteps. She had this thing with pigeons — she'd chase them every single day, never catching one, never stopping. She wasn't sick. She wasn't old. She was alive in the fullest sense of the word.</p>
        <p>Then she sustained a terminal injury — sudden, irreversible. The vet confirmed what we feared. There was nothing left to treat. All we could do was sit with her, keep her comfortable, and make sure she wasn't alone at the end.</p>
        <p>We buried her in the same community she'd lived in all her life. It was the hardest thing I'd done at that point. It taught me something important: this work isn't just about saving lives. Sometimes it's about being present for the ones you can't save.</p>
        <p class="text-foreground/50 italic">We miss you, Mili. Even the pigeons aren't the same without you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border bg-black media-player" data-player="mili">
        <div class="sensitive-banner hidden bg-amber-500/10 border-b border-amber-500/20 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.964-.833-2.732 0L4.082 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z"/></svg>
          Some content may be disturbing. Use the eye icon to reveal.
        </div>
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/9] md:aspect-[21/9]">
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Mili — the way we remember her"><img src={miliAlive.src} alt="Mili" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="video" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Mili playing in the community"><video class="w-full h-full object-contain" playsinline preload="none" muted loop><source src="/videos/mili-playing-1.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="video" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Mili — full of life"><video class="w-full h-full object-contain" playsinline preload="none" muted loop><source src="/videos/mili-playing-2.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700 is-sensitive" data-type="video" data-sensitive="true" data-label="At the vet — final days"><video class="w-full h-full object-contain" playsinline preload="none" muted loop><source src="/videos/mili-vet.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video><div class="blur-overlay"></div><button class="eye-toggle" title="Reveal"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/></svg></button></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700 is-sensitive" data-type="video" data-sensitive="true" data-label="Laid to rest — buried in her community"><video class="w-full h-full object-contain" playsinline preload="none" muted loop><source src="/videos/mili-burial.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video><div class="blur-overlay"></div><button class="eye-toggle" title="Reveal"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/></svg></button></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-black/20 pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-5 z-10"><span class="player-label text-sm text-white/90 font-medium">Mili — the way we remember her</span></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-5 flex gap-1.5 z-10 player-dots"></div>
          <button class="nav-prev absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 hover:bg-black/60 transition-all z-10"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg></button>
          <button class="nav-next absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 hover:bg-black/60 transition-all z-10"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-5 py-2 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-400/60 font-mono">⚠ contains sensitive content</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-white/30 font-mono">1 photo · 4 videos</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ══ 03 · SUKHI · 2025 ══ -->
    <article>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400">03</span>
        <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-border"></div>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono">2025</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500/10 text-violet-400 text-xs">Rescued with help of Goodoo</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">Sukhi</h2>
      <div class="text-sm md:text-base text-secondary leading-relaxed space-y-5 max-w-3xl">
        <p>A female Labrador — abandoned, visibly malnourished, in terrible shape. After Rocky, I'd stopped being able to look away from dogs like her. She needed help immediately. Not tomorrow. Now.</p>
        <p>I reached out to <a href="https://goodoo.org.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-foreground hover:text-green transition-colors underline underline-offset-4 decoration-border hover:decoration-green">Goodoo Animal Welfare Trust</a>, who coordinated her rescue, arranged shelter, and managed her medical rehabilitation over several weeks. She recovered fully. We named her Sukhi — <em>the happy one</em>.</p>
        <p>Rocky was instinct. Sukhi was a choice. That difference matters. This was the moment it stopped being a one-off act and became something I knew I'd keep doing — not out of obligation, but because once you see the suffering clearly, indifference stops being an option.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border bg-black media-player" data-player="sukhi">
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/9] md:aspect-[21/9]">
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Sukhi — rescued and recovering"><img src={sukhiClose.src} alt="Sukhi" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Learning to trust"><img src={sukhiPortrait2.src} alt="Sukhi petted" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Peaceful nights"><img src={sukhiResting.src} alt="Sukhi resting" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="photo" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Getting the care she deserves"><img src={sukhiHappy2.src} alt="Sukhi at vet" class="w-full h-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="media-slide absolute inset-0 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-700" data-type="video" data-sensitive="false" data-label="Sukhi's rescue — with help from Goodoo"><video class="w-full h-full object-contain" playsinline preload="none" muted loop><source src="/videos/sukhi-rescue.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-black/20 pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-5 z-10"><span class="player-label text-sm text-white/90 font-medium">Sukhi — rescued and recovering</span></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-5 flex gap-1.5 z-10 player-dots"></div>
          <button class="nav-prev absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 hover:bg-black/60 transition-all z-10"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg></button>
          <button class="nav-next absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 hover:bg-black/60 transition-all z-10"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 bg-black/50 px-5 py-2 flex items-center justify-end">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-white/30 font-mono">4 photos · 1 video</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ══ 04 · BRUNO · 2025 ══ -->
    <article>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-green">04</span>
        <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-border"></div>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-green/10 text-green text-xs font-mono">2025</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-green/10 text-green text-xs">Happy ending</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">Bruno</h2>
      <div class="text-sm md:text-base text-secondary leading-relaxed space-y-5 max-w-3xl">
        <p>Not every rescue involves injury or illness. Bruno was a pet dog — separated from his family, wandering the streets alone. Confused. Scared. Completely out of his depth in a world that doesn't slow down for a lost animal.</p>
        <p>We found him, kept him safe, and tracked down his family. The reunion was one of those rare, uncomplicated moments in this work — no grey area, no compromise. Just a dog running back to the people who love him. Every rescue should feel this way. Most don't.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border bg-black media-player" data-player="bruno">
