    <!-- The Real Cost -->
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 mb-8">// The real cost</p>
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-sm md:text-base text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        <p>Since 2024, I've spent close to <span class="text-foreground font-semibold">₹1,25,000</span> on this — rescues, rehabilitation, vaccinations, medicines, treatments, surgeries, and burials for the ones we lost. On top of that, roughly <span class="text-foreground font-semibold">₹4,000 every month</span> goes toward feeding 20+ community dogs every single night. All out of pocket. No fundraisers, no sponsors.</p>
        <p>I'm not sharing this number to impress anyone. I'm sharing it because it needs to be said clearly: <span class="text-foreground">this was never about money</span>. It was about showing up for living beings that have no voice, no advocate, and no way to ask for help. Every rupee went toward an animal that was suffering in silence while the world walked past.</p>
        <p>The real cost isn't financial. It's the dog you couldn't get to in time. The one the vet said was too far gone. The burial you handled yourself at midnight. That stays with you in a way no expense report ever could.</p>
        <p class="text-foreground/70 font-medium">If any of this resonated with you — if even one of these stories made you pause — consider supporting the organizations that made this work possible. They do this at a scale I never could, and they need all the help they can get.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Donation CTA -->
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 max-w-2xl">
        <a href="https://alairescues.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group rounded-xl border border-green/20 bg-green/[0.03] p-6 hover:border-green/40 hover:bg-green/[0.06] transition-all">
          <Image src={alaiLogo} alt="ALAI" class="h-10 w-auto mb-4" />
          <h3 class="text-foreground font-semibold text-sm mb-1.5 group-hover:text-green transition-colors">Donate to ALAI</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary text-xs leading-relaxed mb-3">Animal rescue and rehabilitation shelter in Bangalore. Palliative care, canine distemper treatment, and spine care units. Operating since 2017.</p>
